### contracts.rest — Contrato digital de la reserva
### Módulo: src/contracts/contracts.controller.ts (ContractsModule)
### Todas las rutas requieren JWT + VerifiedAccountGuard; accept además lleva
### @RequireVerifiedAccount(). El contrato se genera con los snapshots que
### quedan congelados al aceptar la reserva (PATCH /bookings/:id/accept).
###
### Elegí entorno con "Switch Environment" (local/production). Ver REST_CLIENT.md.
### Mantenimiento: si cambia este endpoint, actualizá este archivo en el mismo
### cambio (ver CLAUDE.md).

### ── Setup: owner con listing + renter + reserva ACCEPTED (ver bookings.rest) ──

@ownerEmail = contracts-owner-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@renterEmail = contracts-renter-{{$timestamp}}@test.local
@password = TestPass123!
@ownerCode = 000000
@renterCode = 000000

# @name ownerRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{ownerEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del owner de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name ownerRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{ownerEmail}}",
  "code": "{{ownerCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Carla",
  "lastName": "Owner",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1992-07-15"
}

@ownerToken = {{ownerRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}

# @name renterRegisterStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/start
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "email": "{{renterEmail}}" }

### ⚠️ Copiá el código del renter de la consola del server antes de seguir.
# @name renterRegisterComplete
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/complete
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{renterEmail}}",
  "code": "{{renterCode}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Bruno",
  "lastName": "Renter",
  "acceptedTerms": true,
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-03-10"
}

@renterToken = {{renterRegisterComplete.response.body.$.accessToken}}

# @name createVehicle
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "brand": "Toyota", "model": "Corolla", "year": 2021, "category": "SEDAN" }

@vehicleId = {{createVehicle.response.body.$.id}}

# @name createListing
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "title": "Toyota Corolla 2021",
  "description": "Auto full equipo, service al día, ideal para viajes largos.",
  "pricePerDay": 15000,
  "locationText": "Av. Corrientes 1234, CABA",
  "latitude": -34.6037,
  "longitude": -58.3816,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

@listingId = {{createListing.response.body.$.id}}

# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

{
  "listingId": "{{listingId}}",
  "startDate": "2026-09-10",
  "endDate": "2026-09-15"
}

@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

# @name acceptBooking
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Obtiene el contrato digital de la reserva (terms) como participante.
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 2. Registra la aceptación del renter.
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/bookings/{{bookingId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}

### 3. Registra la aceptación del owner.
POST {{baseUrl}}/contracts/bookings/{{bookingId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 4. Descarga el contrato en PDF (application/pdf — en VS Code REST Client
### usá "Save Response" o el botón de preview para verlo).
GET {{baseUrl}}/contracts/bookings/{{bookingId}}/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{renterToken}}
